From fcacfe2298a46768c6d529d59793058510b32682 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 18:00:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Set feeds of selected rules in the rules panel

Replaces the feed filter dropdown (hard to read in dark mode, and not
what was asked) and the small feed icon/dialog with an editor that takes
over the right-hand panel whenever rules are ticked. It lists every feed
with its URL (so feeds with the same title can be told apart) and an
on / off / mixed state for the selection, with "Use all" / "Use none",
a sticky "Save feeds for N rules" bar, and Delete / Clear selection.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013nmSf2zmYoNEfzcNutPGUX
